{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":59136,\"title\":\"For Richer, for Poorer\",\"tagline\":\"Dad's a self-made millionaire. His son just has it made. Now Dad's about to give it all away to get his son to make his own.\",\"overview\":\"Fresh out of college, a young man lazes about his family's estate, which irritates his father, a self-made millionaire who hatches a bankruptcy plan that he hopes will inspire his son to get a job.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/snm3gnbwpMrKySutTVRQt3w7In5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tTkwnlhm6tLxBxcdwJfbwOzPBPl.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"voteCount\":14,\"year\":1992,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Jay Sandrich\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":51760,\"name\":\"Jay Sandrich\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qv6zrBlI8bAPBnRXYTtT7o8JY12.jpg\"},{\"id\":3151,\"name\":\"Jack Lemmon\",\"character\":\"Aram Katourian\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7jWVWLr1VJqQrN3d4YJaATCIHRw.jpg\"},{\"id\":3094,\"name\":\"Talia Shire\",\"character\":\"Millie Katourian\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oktJmlLeyYKBCWPNjHskDwAfjct.jpg\"},{\"id\":55265,\"name\":\"Jonathan Silverman\",\"character\":\"Michael Katourian\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tzGuPePIxTjV84qizCMDcqTEQgh.jpg\"},{\"id\":20747,\"name\":\"Joanna Gleason\",\"character\":\"Irene\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vBufIrlapxpuRlzeSIMXtuFO5XK.jpg\"},{\"id\":29803,\"name\":\"Madeline Kahn\",\"character\":\"Billie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5jbkrxx0uaymKDnv5EImUXxWQyN.jpg\"},{\"id\":14669,\"name\":\"George Wyner\",\"character\":\"Harry\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2c5axrzorErAwJ6Qts8o79r9Z6r.jpg\"},{\"id\":43364,\"name\":\"Dakin Matthews\",\"character\":\"Larr