":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13690,\"title\":\"Open Season 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lM4bahouPblYcfngZtnNSkaWxCU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dnZdaGpQ36DlPkyr2bvaxPvc2OA.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After falling head over hooves in love with Giselle, Elliot's road to the altar takes a slight detour when Mr. Weenie is kidnapped by a group of pampered pets determined to return him to his owners.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1493400,\"title\":\"Camp Rock 3\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rS7byWK9cfPfdLeFNlRIaJxH9mN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vJb3fniB8E0JnSMr1tDyIsb6gPi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When pop group Connect 3 returns to Camp Rock to search for an opening act for their reunion tour, rising tensions and fierce competition among campers test old friendships and spark unexpected romances.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10947,\"title\":\"High School Musical\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1DGmWZjUJPeKGFRHGCA6VPFUBML.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2p1nyBVSEBiCTrrZeVSV9nIsqHr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A popular high school athlete and an academically gifted