80/ysQqYp9G37Q114Nc6uvCHbDmaj6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cwQ7IO6ZNBnlQ1b8zA7pXzkdT5S.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A harried prehistoric bird mother entrusts her precious, soon-to-hatch egg to Sid. When she recommends him to her neighbours, business booms at his new egg-sitting service. However, dastardly pirate bunny, Squint, who is seeking revenge on the herd, steals, camouflages and hides all the eggs. Once again, with Squint’s twin brother assisting, Manny, Diego and the rest of the gang come to the rescue and take off on a daring mission that turns into the world’s first Easter egg hunt.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":27874,\"title\":\"A Wrinkle in Time\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mMES5XApmhBmc06RxsT1a0DmUHQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nW6Tm8zHmVIyfCZPVyl4akD5RMZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Meg and Charles Wallace are aided by Calvin and three interesting women in the search for their father who disappeared during a government experiment. Their travels take them around the universe to a place unlike any other.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":35979,\"title\":\"Pumpkinhead: Blood Feud\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/beh3X6LZKd7kai0RaxqeiP5WHHy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5NwBbP8BQMSP8ehqy1aQe3ns2u2.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a bitter family feud, Jodie Hatfield, and her boyfriend Ricky McCoy, decide to leave town to avoid being found out, but are soon caught in the act. Wanting vengeance, he seeks out the monster Pumpkinhead, and resurrects it seek revenge on the family. Despite being warned away by the ghost of Ed Harley, his vengeance plan starts out, and the Hatfield family is soon under siege by the powerful demon. Not accepting the legend of the creature and believing their arch-rivals are the real cause, the two families attempt to go to war, only to be stopped when Pumpkinhead attacks the Hatfield house. Putting aside their differences, they band together to stave off the creature before it's vengeance pact is completed.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460097,\"title\":\"The Wrong Bed: Naked Pursuit\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e4Z7crPzrrK9e9oTriqSYtwRgAI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5nv5EMxKvxqvgxoELVwvE0odOHE.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A woman mysteriously wakes up in a hotel handcuffed to a firefighter to find messages they left themselves the night before revealing that their lives are in danger.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"J9kBohmnmWM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"9jY1CGCw6dc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"sQNmhm3wxMI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}